= Vincent Auriol

Auriol is an economist and a disciple of Karl Kautsky. Originating from Vienna, Austria, he trained as a medical doctor, but later became involved in Marxist economics as a discipline. He has been the lead ideologist of our party since the Heidelberg Program of 1925.

