@against_right_and_left
title: Against Right and Left
subtitle: As a Centrist, Auriol seeks to steer a course between the party's factions.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 5; advisor_action_time = time; center_strength += 10; left_strength -= 5; labor_strength -= 5; neorevisionist_strength -= 5; center_dissent -= 10

We have reduced the strength of the dissident factions in the party.

@toleration
title: Defending Toleration
subtitle: Auriol supports cooperation with the bourgeois parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not sfio_toleration: The SFIO is not in toleration. ?]
choose-if: sfio_in_government = 0 and sfio_toleration = 1 and advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 5

We have reduced dissent among the anti-toleration factions.

@finance_ministry_
title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: As Finance Minister, Auriol can enact tax policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if sfio_in_government = 0 : SFIO not in government: ?] [? if finance_minister_party != "SFIO" : The SFIO does not control the finance ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and sfio_in_government == 1 and finance_minister_party == "SFIO"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; fiscal_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: fiscal_policy

@judiciary_
title: Judicial Affairs
subtitle: Enact judicial reforms.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and sfio_in_government and justice_minister_party = "SFIO"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not sfio_in_government : The SFIO is not currently in government. ?][? if justice_minister_party != "SFIO" : We do not have the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; judiciary_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: judiciary
